  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Power Sector Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project supports the Government&apos;s overarching objective of providing sustainable and reliable electricity services to all consumers at cost-efficient prices. The Project will improve the capacity of the power sector to meet growing electricity demand and improve quality, reliability, and cost-effectiveness of power supply by (i) improving the financial performance of EPC, (ii) supporting EPC&apos;s investment plan to meet growing demand, (iii) improving the operational efficiency of EPC, and (iv) establishing effective regulation of the power sector.</narrative>
  </description>
